  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/ADVANCED_STANDS/MP_ADVANCED_STANDS_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>進階武器架</strong> 讓你能夠放置武器、盔甲與工具架，這些架子會自動修復存放在上面的物品。無需工作台、不需要經驗值消耗、也不需要鐵砧。只需放置你的架子，將裝備放上去，然後在你外出探索時讓它自行處理。</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/ADVANCED_STANDS/MP_ADVANCED_STANDS_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">每個架子專門針對特定類型的物品：武器架負責修復劍、弓與遠程武器；工具架專責修復鎬、斧頭、鏟子與鋤頭；而盔甲架則會逐步恢復你整套盔甲的耐久度。再也不用從地牢出來時帶著半壞的鑽石裝備了。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">進階武器架提供六種材質等級，每一級都比前一級修復得更快。在遊戲初期使用基礎的木製架子開始，隨著進度逐步升級，一直到使用下界合金材質的架子，隨時保持你最頂級的裝備處於完美狀態。</span></p>\n<table style=\"width:92.9688%;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:32.5386%;text-align:left\"><strong>等級</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:67.4614%;text-align:left\"><strong>修復速度</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:32.5386%\">木材</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.4614%\">無法修復</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:32.5386%\">銅</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.4614%\">修復完整個鑽石頭盔約需 3 小時</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:32.5386%\">鐵</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.4614%\">約 2 小時</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:32.5386%\">金</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.4614%\">約 1 小時 20 分鐘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:32.5386%\">鑽石</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.4614%\">約 30 分鐘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:32.5386%\">下界合金</td>\n<td style=\"width:67.4614%\">約 10 分鐘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">合成</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">武器架</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6495167b-3729-4ea0-92cb-1e418516ef1d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"193\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">工具架</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0f9bbc79-d1de-4c26-9fcf-93283c9d9501.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"378\" height=\"196\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">盔甲架</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_889cd00d-c141-4b4b-9774-0508805f8887.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"379\" height=\"193\"></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">升級你的架子</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">你不需要每次都重新合成每個等級的架子。只要先放置一個架子，然後用 8 塊下一等級的材質方塊包圍它，它就會自動升級——同時保留原本的位置、存放的物品以及修復進度。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ff858b42-ce04-4184-b577-6dfcf62fbec9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"337\" height=\"173\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bf5ed7d2-9134-4ffb-bf28-e8c02a2a09c8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"337\" height=\"174\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/ADVANCED_STANDS/MP_ADVANCED_STANDS_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"799\" height=\"118\"></strong></a></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即擁有你自己的 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"> 並與朋友享受無盡的冒險！我們提供頂級效能與穩定連線，保證讓每位玩家都能享受流暢有趣的遊戲體驗。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong> </a>即可享有 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/ADVANCED_STANDS/MP_ADVANCED_STANDS_Discord.webp\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></span></a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
